==Battleground==
*1 [[Doge]] spawns.
*2 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 9.33~17.33 seconds<sup>280f~520f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**10 [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn as the boss.
**8 [[Rat Doge|Rat Doges]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use cheap cats like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] to beat the stage.

